{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"91653ed370d043dca59c895ba89258dfb24f2fc8d74ba061b7bc9c009245a193","ja":"いざ、早押し！","zh":"来吧，抢答！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"606979b1decf2d106c1475d4c2b1bf6c413716e221d49d43bca78792d0a93d5f","ja":"そしてクイズ番組、収録当日……","zh":"然后到了答题节目收录当天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f6b119c96b317835eaf339f43d5eeb3e3ef56092586d5abce262e1854f9fa247","ja":"「次は動物に関する問題です！\n犬が尻尾を下げたまま振……」","zh":"「下一题是关于动物的问题！\n狗垂着尾巴摇……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e527a3d4b131f743bd5edba308a26f71b98a3efe47cf47458556a6ca54152b56","ja":"はい！　それはリラックスしてるときだぞ！\n……って答えでいいよね！？","zh":"好！那是在放松的时候哦！\n……这么回答就可以了吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f2b3196241bfd205a7f2c891d63bd8c033f4711c944820ded68bced8a68f8c70","ja":"「正解！　1ポイント獲得！」","zh":"「回答正确！　获得1积分！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a4e51ae9976679e0bd06e0282eaa182fc93d5e69a1d36668bf705f40e49fb95c","ja":"ワオ！　ヒビキ、ナイス早押しだネ～！","zh":"哇哦！响，抢答得好快呢～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cd30289a40fe0b23b83524e52a66e41a043a9c13f4a05e573901fa7587037839","ja":"えへへ♪　動物のクイズなら負けないからさ～！","zh":"嘿嘿♪　要是动物谜题的话，我可不会输哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"bc18431cbce03f5ef666af3c64a2647565884f018e4e1561d588b6720dee63c9","ja":"「では次！　難しくなりますよ～。\n世界三大珍獣をすべて答えてください！」","zh":"「那么下一题！难度要增加了哦～。\n请回答出所有的世界三大珍兽！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"cf9697f1818481e178df44004ecd9730c6d1c9930ef9f083b2cab1de082ad9da","ja":"ええっ！？　パンダがいた気がするけど……\nあとはなんだったっけ！？","zh":"咦！？我记得好像有熊猫……\n还有什么来着！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"23cbded672bb2085b266175c5b73abadc490a41cb8de41e037bef679c6174641","ja":"「はい！　ジャイアントパンダ、\nオカピ、コビトカバです！」","zh":"「好的！是大熊猫、\n㺢㹢狓、倭河马！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d96653eafb4eaf76789afbc120e67185240a2d6798a364b1325fae1890693d96","ja":"「正解！　お見事、3ポイント獲得です！」","zh":"「回答正确！太精彩了，获得3点积分！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"87146b772b16a6036275f7b44c9729c30eb1f9a424e0ede612e0a1bb89094da6","ja":"「次は地理です。南アメリカに関する問題！\n南アメリカで一番大きな……」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e937dcd0f81e8408249a0956e95097ec45231d2117c12fbeaf0a5106ef3b918c","ja":"ハ～イ♪　それはブラジルだヨ～！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"042f4f8dfceda4430d9d89475cc177ff344082ceeb9af27dbc42b9b41f4b2e7b","ja":"「正解、1ポイント！　ここから難しくなりますよ！\nブラジルの世界遺産を3つお答えください！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"151d3ee546859d7b22b291e6f46966071b6591ff7e684c389cf9418227d697a1","ja":"世界遺産を3つ！？\nうう……そんなにわからないヨ～！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"7f7af65bde75c02baf9242bfa25a3684e0a85d0d2f231220ecb23f586f3079b9","ja":"「はい！　リオデジャネイロと、\nブラジリアと、イグアス国立公園です！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"28ce279c0aba28f28d65d6ffe57f4f0f1cd3465d75f8bc6b84411a6706969345","ja":"「正解、3ポイント！　響・エレナチームが\nやや劣勢か！　優勝は果たしてどのチームだ～！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1685.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d225e2fab1b95676f880a50c22a3f18792c86381c102b1bb98fde83c85eed947","ja":"うが～っ！　難しくて点数が高い問題が、\n全然、答えられないぞ～っ！！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
